## Conclusion

Extending the simple GPIO into a multi-register, software-controlled peripheral provided hands-on experience with how real SoC peripherals are designed and accessed. The final design integrates smoothly with the existing RISC-V SoC and demonstrates complete end-to-end control from software to hardware.
